            "electrical_reason": "The complementary transmission devices and inverter form a credible selector: in manual mode the mgc devices are enabled, while in automatic mode the agc devices are enabled; the forced-selector measurements confirm this. However, a selector that passes an externally forced agc does not repair the absent DC/averaged detector-to-agc control path."
