    "summary": "The input TIA/cancellation, two RF gain stages, output buffer, and active peak detector are coherently implemented. The AGC amplifier is structurally unable to use the detector\u2019s averaged output because its only detector-input connections are capacitive; while the selector itself is valid, this materially breaks both the AGC section and complete receiver integration."
